shuttle), I would love to see it so we know where we're at with
backgrounds.

Oh yeah, we're changing it so it's an O'Neill Cylinder. =D

Much more feasible idea, and possibly more appealing to all audiences.

We need to plan out the layout of said cylinder, though.

Anybody that isn't working on the script itself, please help plan out
the layout of the cylinder.
It's 8km diametre and 32km long each, two of these to a whole unit.
http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Island_Three
^ references for schematics.

I shouldn't have to say this, but please avoid any kind of social,
ethnic, religious, or other kinds of segregation for each of the three
strips. I can see this already as being a problem, so please avoid
this idea at all costs. If anything, make one a shopping district or
something. We should also use the idea of an outer ring for
agricultural purposes and using the centre area for 0g recreational
services.


